        "content": "# Compare Scenarios writes this code from its inputs: each input, under the\n# id and the name of its scenario. It is written again when they change.\nreturn curio_stack_scenarios([\n    (\"existing\", \"Existing\", [!! input_0 !!]),\n    (\"towers-removed\", \"Towers removed\", [!! input_1 !!]),\n])\n",
